# Frontend (Vite). Copy to .env in THIS directory and fill in.
#
# Vite reads .env from the Vite project root (apps/web), not the repo root.
# Only VITE_-prefixed variables reach client code, via import.meta.env.
#
# These values are inlined into the production bundle and are visible to every
# visitor. Never put a secret here — server secrets belong in the root .env.
#
# Nothing is required today: the dev proxy target is set in vite.config.ts and
# API calls are same-origin (/api/...). Listed as an example only.

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
